          { q: "Where do unpaid internships still persist today according to the passage?", options: ["In every large technology company", "In some non-profits and congressional offices", "Mainly in summer manufacturing plants", "They have been completely eliminated"], answer: "B", tip: "unpaid positions persist in some non-profit organizations and congressional offices。" }
