          { q: "What did the grassland experiment demonstrate?", options: ["Single-species plots grew fastest", "Nitrogen vanished from all soils", "Diverse plots were more productive and drought-resistant", "Biodiversity had no measurable effect"], answer: "C", tip: "多物种样方 produced more biomass ... retained nitrogen ... resisted drought and recovered faster。" },
          { q: "How does the professor connect biodiversity to medicine?", options: ["Zoos train most of the world's doctors", "Extinct species are easily cloned back", "Only tropical animals carry useful bacteria", "Many prescription drugs originated from wild organisms"], answer: "D", tip: "half of all prescription drugs ... originated ... from wild organisms。" }
