          { q: "What extra benefit beyond money do participants receive?", options: ["A guaranteed grade in psychology", "A free one-year gym membership", "Priority housing on campus", "A personal sleep report"], answer: "D", tip: "you each receive a personal sleep report，学生普遍觉得很有意思。" }
