          { q: "What broader point does the professor make about invention?", options: ["Gutenberg created every element alone", "East Asia had no printing before Europe", "Religion never interacts with technology", "Social conditions determine whether technology becomes revolutionary"], answer: "D", tip: "Inventions matter, but so does the world waiting to receive them。" }
